 22	// The backdrop renders inside a `<canvas layoutsubtree>`, and liquid-dom draws
 23	// refracting glass under each `.glass` element in `targetRoots`. Without WebGPU or
 24	// Chromium's HTML-in-Canvas API (web preview, old GPU, lost device), the backdrop
 25	// stays plain DOM and the CSS glass remains.
